@startuml
title A-COP 계획 기반 유스케이스 — Runtime / CS Pack / Commerce Ops Pack
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #faf9ff
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4b5563
skinparam LineColor #4b5563
skinparam usecaseBorderThickness 1
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor #6b7280
  BackgroundColor<<common>> #dbeafe
  BorderColor<<common>> #2563eb
  BackgroundColor<<core>> #fef3c7
  BorderColor<<core>> #d97706
  BackgroundColor<<cs>> #dcfce7
  BorderColor<<cs>> #16a34a
  BackgroundColor<<commerce>> #ede9fe
  BorderColor<<commerce>> #7c3aed
  BackgroundColor<<approval>> #fee2e2
  BorderColor<<approval>> #dc2626
}

actor "고객" as Customer
actor "외부 개인 AI\n(REST / MCP)" as PersonalAI
actor "외부 기업 Agent\n(A2A)" as EnterpriseAgent

rectangle "A-COP Runtime" {
  package "Core 1 — Case Runtime & Coordination" {
    usecase "Case 등록" as Create <<common>>
    usecase "Case 분류\nintent / issue / sentiment" as Classify <<common>>
    usecase "Context Pack 구성" as Context <<common>>
    usecase "Team 실행 조정" as Execute <<core>>
    usecase "Case 상태 대기·재개·재계획" as WaitResume <<core>>
    usecase "TeamResult 정규화" as Normalize <<core>>
    usecase "ActionProposal 생성" as Proposal <<approval>>
    usecase "Human Approval" as Approval <<approval>>
    usecase "승인된 Action 실행·감사" as Action <<approval>>
  }

  package "CS Pack — 착수 확정" {
    usecase "VOC & Store Manager\n집계·alert·위임 제안" as VOC <<cs>>
    usecase "Response Generation & Review\nGEN → REV → 응답/에스컬레이션" as Response <<cs>>
  }

  package "Commerce Ops Pack — 검증 쇼핑몰 연계" {
    usecase "Procurement +\nOrder & Payment" as Procurement <<commerce>>
    usecase "Fulfillment &\nLogistics" as Fulfillment <<commerce>>
    usecase "Return & Refund\n(Mock)" as Return <<commerce>>
    usecase "Catalog & Verification\n(A2A Remote)" as Catalog <<commerce>>
  }
}

rectangle "외부 연동 경계" {
  usecase "개인 AI Tool/Resource\n조회·Case 요청" as MCP <<common>>
  usecase "기업 업무 위임\nAgent Card → Task → Artifact" as A2A <<commerce>>
}

' 운영자는 뒤에서 선언하고 Approval·VOC 쪽으로 숨은 엣지를 걸어
' Core 1 박스를 가로지르지 않고 오른쪽 클러스터에 배치되게 유도한다.
actor "운영자" as Operator

Customer --> Create
Customer --> MCP
PersonalAI --> MCP
EnterpriseAgent --> A2A
Operator --> Approval
Operator --> VOC
Operator -[hidden]right-> Approval
Operator -[hidden]right-> VOC

Create ..> Classify : <<include>>
Classify ..> Context : <<include>>
Context ..> Execute : <<include>>
Execute ..> Normalize : <<include>>
Execute ..> VOC : capability
Execute ..> Response : capability
Execute ..> Procurement : capability
Execute ..> Fulfillment : capability
Execute ..> Return : capability
Execute ..> Catalog : capability / A2A
Execute ..> WaitResume : <<extend>>
Normalize ..> Proposal : if action proposed
Proposal ..> Approval : if high-risk
Approval ..> Action : approved
MCP ..> Create : <<include>>
A2A ..> Catalog : remote team

legend bottom right
|=색상 |=의미|
|<#dbeafe>|공통 접근·조회·Context|
|<#fef3c7>|Core 실행·조정|
|<#dcfce7>|CS Pack Team|
|<#ede9fe>|Commerce Ops / A2A Team|
|<#fee2e2>|Action·승인 경계|
|=선 |=의미|
|실선|액터 연관|
|점선 <<include>>|필수 포함|
|점선 <<extend>>|조건부 확장|
endlegend
@enduml
